Package: com.niubiprass.debsbatch
Name: DebsBatch
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Batch upload local .deb files from the Debs app Downloads page to a bound GitHub repo. Git blob + readback SHA verify, per-file results, stoppable queue. Reuses the app's own bound repo config.
Author: Niubiprass
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Niubiprass <maintainer@localhost>